  description: 'Aspect of speed and aerial dominance.


    This mask carries the
    essence of Garuda, ruler of wind and skies.

    Movement becomes instinct, and
    combat becomes a relentless hunt.

    You strike swiftly, reposition instantly,
    and dominate from above.


    Garuda does not face her prey she descends upon
    it.'
